{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "b7e3c1a4-6f20-4d8a-9c51-nextx-mobile-api",
    "name": "NEXTX Mobile API",
    "description": "ทุกเส้นของ nextx-mobile-api (Express)\n\nBase URL ตั้งที่ตัวแปร collection `baseUrl` (default http://localhost:4000)\n\nAuth (transition mode):\n- Bearer {{accessToken}} ที่ระดับ collection (ใช้เมื่อมี OAuth)\n- Header X-User-Id / X-Business-Id สำหรับโหมด legacy (AUTH_TRANSITION_MODE)\n\nเส้น /health และ /ready ไม่ต้องมี auth\nPOST /api/auth/login ไม่ใช้ Bearer (ปิด auth ที่ request)\n\nโมดูลที่อนุญาต: users, business, leads, contacts, tasks",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{accessToken}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:4000"
    },
    {
      "key": "accessToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "userId",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "businessId",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "module",
      "value": "leads"
    },
    {
      "key": "entityId",
      "value": "1"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /health",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/health",
            "description": "Liveness. ไม่ผ่าน rate limiter. Response: status S, data.ok, postgres, mongodb"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /ready",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/ready",
            "description": "Readiness. 200 เมื่อ Postgres และ Mongo พร้อม, 503 เมื่อยังไม่พร้อม"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /api/health",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/health",
            "description": "Health ภายใต้ /api (ผ่าน rate limiter). ไม่ต้อง auth"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /api/ready",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/ready",
            "description": "Readiness ภายใต้ /api. 503 เมื่อ DB ยังไม่พร้อม"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /api/auth/login",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"code\": \"authorization_code_here\",\n  \"codeVerifier\": \"pkce_code_verifier\",\n  \"redirectUri\": \"http://localhost:8081/callback\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
            "description": "แลก authorization code + PKCE เป็น token\n\nBody:\n- code (string, min 8) required\n- codeVerifier (string, min 8) required\n- redirectUri (url) optional — ถ้าไม่ส่งใช้ OAUTH_REDIRECT_URI\n\n201/200 data: token_type, access_token, expires_in, refresh_token, id_token, scope\n401 AUTH_LOGIN_EXCHANGE_FAILED"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Session",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /api/me",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-User-Id",
                "value": "{{userId}}",
                "description": "ใช้เมื่อ AUTH_TRANSITION_MODE=true และยังไม่มี Bearer"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-Business-Id",
                "value": "{{businessId}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/me",
            "description": "ผู้ใช้และธุรกิจปัจจุบันจาก aicrm_users / aicrm_business\nต้องมี Bearer (claim sub + business_id) หรือ header X-User-Id + X-Business-Id\n\nScope: ไม่ตรวจ scope แยก แค่ business context"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /api/admin/policy-check",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-User-Id",
                "value": "{{userId}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-Business-Id",
                "value": "{{businessId}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/admin/policy-check",
            "description": "ตรวจ policy admin. ต้องมี OAuth scope `admin` (legacy header ไม่ผ่านเส้นนี้)\n403 AUTH_SCOPE_REQUIRED ถ้าไม่มี scope"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Modules",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /api/modules",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-User-Id",
                "value": "{{userId}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-Business-Id",
                "value": "{{businessId}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/modules",
            "description": "รายการโมดูลที่อนุญาต\nScope: modules:read (legacy bypass ได้)\n\nResponse data: [{ module, table }]"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Fields",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /api/fields/:module",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-User-Id",
                "value": "{{userId}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-Business-Id",
                "value": "{{businessId}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/fields/{{module}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "fields", "{{module}}"]
            },
            "description": "คอลัมน์ของตารางโมดูลจาก information_schema\nScope: fields:read\nmodule: users | business | leads | contacts | tasks\n\nResponse data: { module, table, fields: [{ column_name, data_type }] }"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Picklists",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /api/picklists",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-User-Id",
                "value": "{{userId}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-Business-Id",
                "value": "{{businessId}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/picklists?limit=20&offset=0",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "picklists"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "limit",
                  "value": "20",
                  "description": "1-100, default 20"
                },
                {
                  "key": "offset",
                  "value": "0",
                  "description": ">= 0, default 0"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "รายการ aicrm_picklists ของ business ปัจจุบัน\nScope: picklists:read\nถ้าตารางไม่มี (42P01) คืน items ว่าง\n\nResponse data: { items, limit, offset }"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Entity",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /api/entity/:module",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-User-Id",
                "value": "{{userId}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-Business-Id",
                "value": "{{businessId}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/entity/{{module}}?limit=20&offset=0",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "entity", "{{module}}"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "limit",
                  "value": "20",
                  "description": "1-100, default 20"
                },
                {
                  "key": "offset",
                  "value": "0",
                  "description": ">= 0, default 0"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "รายการเรคคอร์ดของโมดูล กรองตาม business ของผู้ใช้\nScope: entity:read\n\nResponse data: { items, limit, offset }"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /api/entity/:module",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-User-Id",
                "value": "{{userId}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-Business-Id",
                "value": "{{businessId}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"payload\": {\n    \"name\": \"Lead from Postman\"\n  }\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/entity/{{module}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "entity", "{{module}}"]
            },
            "description": "สร้างเรคคอร์ด. คอลัมน์ที่ไม่ใช่ของตารางจะถูกตัดทิ้ง. business column ถูกบังคับจาก auth\nScope: entity:write หรือ entity:create\n201 + RETURNING *\n\nBody: { payload: { ...fields } } หรือส่ง field ตรง ๆ ที่ root ก็ได้"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "PUT /api/entity/:module/:id",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-User-Id",
                "value": "{{userId}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-Business-Id",
                "value": "{{businessId}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"payload\": {\n    \"name\": \"Lead updated\"\n  }\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/entity/{{module}}/{{entityId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "entity", "{{module}}", "{{entityId}}"]
            },
            "description": "อัปเดตเรคคอร์ดตาม id ภายใน business ปัจจุบัน\nScope: entity:write หรือ entity:update\nid เป็นจำนวนเต็มบวก\n400 ENTITY_UPDATE_EMPTY ถ้าไม่มีฟิลด์ที่อัปเดตได้\n404 ENTITY_NOT_FOUND"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "DELETE /api/entity/:module/:id",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-User-Id",
                "value": "{{userId}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-Business-Id",
                "value": "{{businessId}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/entity/{{module}}/{{entityId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "entity", "{{module}}", "{{entityId}}"]
            },
            "description": "ลบเรคคอร์ดตาม id ภายใน business ปัจจุบัน\nScope: entity:write หรือ entity:delete\nResponse data: { deletedId }"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /api/entity/:module/:id/duplicate",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-User-Id",
                "value": "{{userId}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-Business-Id",
                "value": "{{businessId}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/entity/{{module}}/{{entityId}}/duplicate",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "entity", "{{module}}", "{{entityId}}", "duplicate"]
            },
            "description": "คัดลอกเรคคอร์ด (ไม่รวม id) แล้ว INSERT\nScope: entity:write หรือ entity:create\n201 + แถวใหม่"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Examples",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /api/example-pg",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-User-Id",
                "value": "{{userId}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-Business-Id",
                "value": "{{businessId}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/example-pg",
            "description": "SELECT 1 as ok บน PostgreSQL. ต้องมี business context"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /api/example-mongo",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-User-Id",
                "value": "{{userId}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-Business-Id",
                "value": "{{businessId}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/example-mongo",
            "description": "อ่านเอกสารจาก Mongo collection (MONGO_COLLECTION หรือ example) สูงสุด 10 รายการ\nต้อง login (authenticated) ไม่บังคับ business context"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
